S('customs-clearance-delhi','Customs Clearance in Delhi: Air Cargo, ICD Tughlakabad and Dadri | YAM Logistics',
 'Import and export customs clearance in Delhi at IGI air cargo, ICD Tughlakabad and ICD Dadri. Licensed customs broker R-7/92, based in New Delhi. Advance filing, duty estimate in 2 hours.',
 'Customs clearance in Delhi','CUSTOMS CLEARANCE · DELHI NCR','Customs clearance in Delhi,','done by a licensed broker.',
 'YAM Logistics is a licensed customs broker (R-7/92) based in New Delhi. We clear import and export cargo at IGI Airport, ICD Tughlakabad and ICD Dadri, and file for sea cargo that arrives at Mundra or Nhava Sheva and moves on to Delhi NCR.',
 [('Where we clear cargo in and around Delhi',[('table',['Location','Station code','Cargo'],[['IGI Airport air cargo','INDEL4','Air import and export'],['ICD Tughlakabad','INTKD6','Containers by rail and road'],['ICD Dadri','INDER6','Containers, including rail from Mundra and Nhava Sheva']],'Station codes are the Indian Customs location codes used on the bill of entry and shipping bill.')]),
  ('What the service covers',['Bill of entry and shipping bill filing on ICEGATE, usually before the cargo arrives.','HS classification and duty working, with the exemption or free trade agreement rate checked.','BIS, FSSAI, WPC, drug licence and other permissions checked before you ship.','Examination and query handling with the officer, and out of charge follow-up.','Export schemes: drawback, RoDTEP and advance authorisation support.','Delivery to your warehouse or factory in Delhi NCR.']),
  ('Why importers in Delhi use a broker based in Delhi',['Your cargo may land at Mundra or Nhava Sheva and be cleared at an inland depot in Delhi NCR. Having the broker in the same city as the depot and the customs office means faster document hand-offs, queries answered the same day and a person you can visit.','We file in advance in most cases, so assessment starts while the ship or flight is still on its way. See how the whole process runs in our guide to the <a href="guides/customs-clearance-process-india" style="color:#0A6CC2">customs clearance process in India</a>.']),
  ('What it costs',['Broker fees depend on the number of line items, the type of cargo and whether examination is needed. Duty, port or depot charges, and transport are separate and paid at actuals. Send us your invoice and we will tell you the full picture before you commit. For the duty alone, use the <a href="customs-duty-calculator" style="color:#0A6CC2">free duty calculator</a> or look up your product on the <a href="import-duty/" style="color:#0A6CC2">import duty by HS code</a> pages.'])],
 [('Do you clear cargo at IGI Airport in Delhi?','Yes. We file and follow import and export cargo at IGI Airport air cargo, station code INDEL4, for both general cargo and cargo that needs permissions.'),
  ('Can you clear a container that arrives at Mundra at ICD Tughlakabad or Dadri?','Yes. The container moves under customs control by rail or road to the inland depot, and we file the bill of entry for the depot so that clearance happens close to your factory.'),
  ('How fast can you give me a duty estimate?','Send the product details and the invoice or a proforma. A licensed broker will give you the classification and an estimate of the duty within 2 working hours.'),
  ('Do I need a customs broker in Delhi?','The law lets an importer file their own bill of entry, but most use a licensed customs broker for speed and accuracy. A broker also handles queries, examination and permissions.')],
 [('customs-brokerage','Customs brokerage','All our clearance services and the 14 stations we cover.'),('guides/delhi-ncr-icds-tughlakabad-dadri-patparganj','Delhi NCR ICDs explained','Tughlakabad, Dadri and Patparganj compared.'),('icd-tughlakabad-customs-clearance','ICD Tughlakabad clearance','Our page for Tughlakabad.'),('icd-dadri-customs-clearance','ICD Dadri clearance','Our page for Dadri.')])

S('customs-broker-in-delhi','Customs Broker in Delhi (CHA, Licence R-7/92) | YAM Logistics',
 'Licensed customs broker in New Delhi, licence R-7/92 since 1992. Import and export clearance, HS classification, permissions and duty advice. Family business since 1968.',
 'Customs broker in Delhi','CUSTOMS BROKER · NEW DELHI','Customs broker in Delhi,','licensed since 1992.',
 'A customs broker, also called a customs house agent or CHA, files your bill of entry or shipping bill and deals with customs for you. YAM Logistics is a licensed customs broker in New Delhi with licence R-7/92, part of a trading family that entered shipping in 1968.',
 [('What a licensed customs broker does',['Classifies your product under the Customs Tariff and works out the duty.','Files the bill of entry or shipping bill on ICEGATE and answers customs queries.','Checks whether the product needs BIS, FSSAI, WPC, a drug licence, a plant or animal quarantine certificate or another permission.','Represents you at examination and follows the cargo until the out of charge order.','Advises on duty saving: free trade agreements, exemption notifications, drawback and RoDTEP.']),
  ('How to choose a customs broker in Delhi',['Ask for the licence number and check it with the Customs commissionerate. A licence is issued by Customs under the Customs Brokers Licensing Regulations.','Ask who in the firm holds the authorised-person card (F card) and answers to Customs for your cargo. At YAM the F card holder is the director, Razi Zaheer.','Ask which stations the broker works at, and whether they also arrange freight and delivery.','Ask how they will tell you the duty before the cargo ships, not after.','Ask what happens when there is a query or an examination, and who you call.'] ),
  ('How YAM works with you',['You send the invoice, packing list and product details. We reply with the HS code, the duty, any permission needed and the documents we still need. After you ship we file in advance, follow the cargo and update you at each step. See the <a href="customs-brokerage" style="color:#0A6CC2">full customs brokerage service</a> or read <a href="guides/customs-broker-role-and-licence" style="color:#0A6CC2">what a customs broker does and how licences work</a>.']),
  ('Our office',['New Delhi: E-51, Kalkaji, New Delhi 110019. We also have offices in Mumbai (sea and Sahar air cargo) and Mundra, so cargo that lands at the port is handled by our own people.'])],
 [('What is a CHA?','CHA stands for customs house agent, the older name for a customs broker. The licence now sits under the Customs Brokers Licensing Regulations, but people still say CHA.'),
  ('Is a customs broker licence the same as an IEC?','No. An IEC is the import export code a business needs to trade. A customs broker licence is what lets a firm act for others in front of Customs.'),
  ('Can I use you only for clearance and book freight elsewhere?','Yes. You can bring your own forwarder or shipping line and we will clear the cargo at the India end.'),
  ('Does YAM only work in Delhi?','No. Our licence covers stations across India and we clear at 14 stations including Mundra, Nhava Sheva, Mumbai air cargo and the Delhi depots.')],
 [('customs-clearance-delhi','Customs clearance in Delhi','IGI, Tughlakabad and Dadri.'),('guides/customs-broker-role-and-licence','Customs broker role and licence','How the licence works.'),('about','About YAM','Since 1968, licensed since 1992.')])

S('freight-forwarder-delhi','Freight Forwarder in Delhi: Sea and Air Freight from India | YAM Logistics',
 'Freight forwarder in New Delhi for sea and air freight, with our own customs licence. Ocean through Mundra and Nhava Sheva, air from IGI and Mumbai, door delivery in Delhi NCR.',
 'Freight forwarder in Delhi','FREIGHT FORWARDER · NEW DELHI','Freight forwarder in Delhi,','with its own customs licence.',
 'Delhi NCR has no seaport, so sea cargo moves through Mundra or Nhava Sheva and then by rail or road to the capital region. YAM Logistics runs that whole chain from New Delhi: booking, port, customs, rail or road haulage and delivery.',
 [('Sea freight for Delhi NCR',['Full container (FCL) and part container (LCL) to and from Mundra, Nhava Sheva and the inland depots at Tughlakabad and Dadri.','Rail haulage between the ports and Delhi NCR, including the Western Dedicated Freight Corridor, which shortens the transit to the northern depots.','Customs clearance at the port or at the depot, under our own licence, so the forwarder and the broker are the same desk.','Read <a href="ocean-freight" style="color:#0A6CC2">ocean freight FCL and LCL</a> or compare <a href="guides/mundra-vs-jnpt-which-port" style="color:#0A6CC2">Mundra and JNPT for Delhi cargo</a>.']),
  ('Air freight from Delhi',['Air export and import through IGI Airport, and through Mumbai, Bengaluru, Hyderabad, Chennai and Ahmedabad.','Dangerous goods, temperature-sensitive cargo and urgent AOG parts.','Pickup in Delhi NCR, airline booking, export clearance and airway bill.','See <a href="air-freight" style="color:#0A6CC2">air freight</a> and the guide to <a href="guides/air-freight-booking-steps" style="color:#0A6CC2">booking air freight step by step</a>.']),
  ('What makes a forwarder with a customs licence different',['A forwarder without a licence hands your customs work to a broker. That is one more party, one more hand-off and one more place for a document to wait. We are both, so quoting, booking, clearance and delivery are one desk and one point of contact.']),
  ('Get a quote',['Send the origin, destination, commodity, weight and volume or the container size, and the Incoterm. We reply with the route, transit time and a landed cost, including duty if it is an import. You can also use the <a href="container-load-planner" style="color:#0A6CC2">free 3D container load planner</a> to see how much will fit.'])],
 [('Is there a seaport in Delhi?','No. Delhi is served by inland container depots such as Tughlakabad and Dadri, which connect by rail to Mundra and Nhava Sheva.'),
  ('Do you handle LCL from Delhi?','Yes. We consolidate LCL through our network at the ports and clear it at the destination, and we will tell you when FCL is cheaper per cubic metre.'),
  ('Can you collect cargo from my factory in Delhi NCR?','Yes. We arrange trucks from the factory to the depot, port or airport, and delivery back at the other end.'),
  ('Do you also clear the cargo?','Yes. YAM holds a customs broker licence, R-7/92, so the same team files the bill of entry or shipping bill.')],
 [('ocean-freight','Ocean freight','FCL and LCL via Nhava Sheva and Mundra.'),('air-freight','Air freight','24x7 desk at Mumbai air cargo.'),('haulage-icd','ICD haulage','Rail and road to the inland depots.')])

S('air-cargo-clearance-delhi-igi','Air Cargo Clearance at Delhi IGI Airport | YAM Logistics',
 'Import and export air cargo clearance at IGI Airport Delhi (INDEL4). Bill of entry, shipping bill, DG cargo and permissions by a licensed customs broker, R-7/92.',
 'Air cargo clearance, Delhi IGI','AIR CARGO · DELHI IGI','Air cargo clearance at','Delhi IGI Airport.',
 'Air cargo moves fast, and so must the paperwork. We clear air imports and exports at IGI Airport, Delhi, station code INDEL4, and also at Mumbai, Bengaluru, Hyderabad, Chennai, Ahmedabad, Lucknow, Kochi and Kozhikode.',
 [('Air import at Delhi',['The airline files the import manifest. We file your bill of entry on ICEGATE, usually before the flight lands, so assessment is done on arrival.','Duty is paid, the officer passes or examines the cargo, and you receive the out of charge order.','The cargo is released from the air cargo terminal against the delivery order and our gate pass.','Typical delays: a wrong HS code, a missing BIS or other permission, and an invoice that does not match the airway bill.']),
  ('Air export from Delhi',['We file the shipping bill, get the let export order and hand the cargo to the airline against the airway bill.','Dangerous goods are packed, labelled and declared to the IATA rules, with the right shipper declaration. See <a href="guides/imdg-vs-iata-dgr-dangerous-goods" style="color:#0A6CC2">the dangerous goods air guide</a> if it applies.','We can claim drawback and RoDTEP on eligible exports.']),
  ('Chargeable weight and rates',['Airlines charge on the greater of actual and volumetric weight. Read <a href="guides/air-freight-chargeable-weight-and-rates" style="color:#0A6CC2">how chargeable weight and air rates work</a> before you pack.']),
  ('Track your air shipment',['Use the free <a href="tracking/" style="color:#0A6CC2">airway bill tracking pages</a> to follow a flight, and the <a href="air-cargo-status-codes" style="color:#0A6CC2">air cargo status codes</a> guide to read what each status means.'])],
 [('What is the customs station code for Delhi air cargo?','IGI Airport air cargo is INDEL4 on Indian Customs documents.'),
  ('Can you clear dangerous goods at Delhi airport?','Yes, when the cargo is properly classified, packed and declared. We check this before the cargo reaches the airline.'),
  ('How long does air cargo clearance take at Delhi?','When the documents are complete and the cargo is not selected for examination, many shipments are released on the day of arrival. Examination or a permission can add days.'),
  ('Can you also arrange the flight?','Yes. We book the airline and clear the cargo, or we clear cargo that your own forwarder has booked.')],
 [('air-freight','Air freight service','Export and import by air.'),('guides/air-freight-booking-steps','How to book air freight','Step by step.'),('guides/volumetric-weight-air-freight','Volumetric weight','How the airline counts your cargo.')])

S('icd-tughlakabad-customs-clearance','ICD Tughlakabad Customs Clearance (INTKD6) | YAM Logistics',
 'Customs clearance at ICD Tughlakabad (INTKD6), Delhi. Import bill of entry, export shipping bill, rail and road from Mundra and Nhava Sheva, by a licensed customs broker.',
 'ICD Tughlakabad customs clearance','ICD TUGHLAKABAD · INTKD6','ICD Tughlakabad','customs clearance.',
 'ICD Tughlakabad in south Delhi is one of the main inland container depots serving the capital. We file import and export documents for cargo at INTKD6 and arrange the rail and road movement to and from the ports.',
 [('How cargo reaches Tughlakabad',['Import containers land at Mundra or Nhava Sheva, move under customs control by rail to the depot, and are cleared there.','A bill of entry is filed for the depot, duty is paid and the container is released to a truck for your premises.','Exports are stuffed at your factory or at the depot, sealed under customs supervision, and move by rail to the port.']),
  ('Why clear at an inland depot',['Duty and examination happen near your factory, not at a congested port.','The container leaves the port quickly, which reduces port storage and detention.','Read the guide to <a href="guides/icd-vs-cfs-vs-port-explained" style="color:#0A6CC2">ICD, CFS and port clearance</a> to decide which fits your cargo.']),
  ('What we do at Tughlakabad',['File the bill of entry or shipping bill and handle queries.','Arrange the road leg from the depot, with trucks for 20 and 40 foot containers.','Coordinate examination, weighment and release with the depot.','Advise on detention, demurrage and free days with the shipping line.'])],
 [('What is the code for ICD Tughlakabad?','INTKD6 is the Indian Customs location code for ICD Tughlakabad.'),
  ('Can I send an export container from Tughlakabad to Mundra?','Yes. Export containers move by rail under customs seal from the depot to the port, subject to the line and the rail schedule.'),
  ('Is Tughlakabad or Dadri better for my cargo?','It depends on where your factory is and on the rail service from your port. See our guide to the Delhi NCR depots, or ask us and we will compare transit and cost.')],
 [('guides/delhi-ncr-icds-tughlakabad-dadri-patparganj','Delhi NCR ICDs compared','Tughlakabad, Dadri and Patparganj.'),('icd-dadri-customs-clearance','ICD Dadri clearance','The other main depot for NCR.'),('haulage-icd','ICD haulage','Rail and road legs.')])

S('icd-dadri-customs-clearance','ICD Dadri Customs Clearance (INDER6) | YAM Logistics',
 'Customs clearance at ICD Dadri (INDER6), Delhi NCR. Import and export filing, rail from Mundra and Nhava Sheva, and trucking to Noida, Ghaziabad and Delhi. Licensed broker R-7/92.',
 'ICD Dadri customs clearance','ICD DADRI · INDER6','ICD Dadri','customs clearance.',
 'ICD Dadri in Gautam Buddh Nagar is a major inland container depot for Delhi NCR and the Western Dedicated Freight Corridor. We file import and export documents for cargo at INDER6 and arrange the haulage.',
 [('Why Dadri matters',['It is connected by rail to Mundra and Nhava Sheva, including over the Western Dedicated Freight Corridor, which cuts transit time for northern India.','It sits close to Noida, Greater Noida, Ghaziabad and the industrial belts of western Uttar Pradesh and Haryana.']),
  ('What we do at Dadri',['File the bill of entry or shipping bill, and respond to customs queries.','Move the container from the depot to your factory or warehouse, or from your factory to the depot for export.','Coordinate examination and release.','Advise on duty, permissions and trade agreement claims before the cargo ships.']),
  ('Documents you need',['Commercial invoice, packing list and bill of lading.','IEC, GST registration and any product licence.','Certificate of origin if you claim a trade agreement rate.','See the full <a href="guides/documents-required-for-import-into-india" style="color:#0A6CC2">import document checklist</a>.'])],
 [('What is the code for ICD Dadri?','INDER6 is the Indian Customs location code for ICD Dadri.'),
  ('Can I clear imports from Mundra at Dadri?','Yes, when the container is booked to move under customs control to the depot. We file the bill of entry for Dadri.'),
  ('Do you deliver to Noida and Ghaziabad?','Yes. We arrange trucks from the depot to your premises in Delhi NCR.')],
 [('icd-tughlakabad-customs-clearance','ICD Tughlakabad clearance','The other main Delhi depot.'),('guides/mundra-port-guide','Mundra port guide','Where Dadri cargo often lands.'),('haulage-icd','ICD haulage','Rail and road legs.')])
